#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:5
#: d30ba9c7952745f59bb6bbba1861a58b
msgid "Center of Gravity"
msgstr "重心"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:7
#: 1de47212b7624bd49fda4b26286c977d
msgid ""
"Getting the center of gravity right in an aircraft is critical for it to fly"
" well."
msgstr "正确设置飞机的重心对其良好飞行至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:10
#: 48238484f7844be0a3acb5fad805a338
msgid ""
"A common adage in aero-modelling is that nose heavy planes fly badly, but "
"tail heavy planes fly once."
msgstr "航模界有句名言：机头重的飞机飞得不好，机尾重的飞机只飞一次。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:13
#: 60c02333affa4502a5b700fe5b4ccb55
msgid ""
"The center of gravity is the balance point of your plane. You will need to "
"move your battery or add and remove weight from your aircraft so that it "
"balances at the right point."
msgstr "重心是飞机的平衡点。需要移动电池或在飞机上增减配重，使其在正确位置保持平衡。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:18
#: 9d9fe306797d4e63be8aae4c4be3c50c
msgid "Check the instructions"
msgstr "查阅说明书"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:20
#: bb7476b608ec412b9a81729fb6a9ca12
msgid ""
"Most planes will come with instructions on the right CoG (center of gravity)"
" of the aircraft. This is often specified as a distance back from the "
"leading edge of the main wing."
msgstr "大多数飞机的说明书中都会注明正确的重心（CoG）位置，通常以从主翼前缘向后的距离来指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:24
#: f75dabae897d46ff8ba61c47786010aa
msgid ""
"unfortunately it is fairly common for instructions manuals for cheaper "
"planes to have an incorrect CoG listed. Try to confirm with on-line forums "
"or someone who has flown the same plane."
msgstr "遗憾的是，廉价飞机的说明书中注明错误重心的情况相当常见。请在在线论坛或向飞过同款飞机的人确认。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:29
#: 331c1ce1c4484292b2f33d2078673948
msgid ""
"Very roughly, you expect the CoG to be about 1/3 of the way back from the "
"front of the wing. If you have doubt about the correct CoG then you should "
"err on the side of making the plane too nose heavy instead of too tail "
"heavy. A nose heavy plane may have trouble taking off and climbing, but it "
"will usually be stable. A tail heavy plane may be very unstable and crash "
"shortly after takeoff."
msgstr ""
"粗略而言，重心应位于机翼前缘向后约 1/3 "
"处。若对正确重心有疑问，宁可让飞机偏机头重而非偏机尾重。机头重的飞机可能起飞和爬升困难，但通常较稳定；机尾重的飞机可能极不稳定，起飞后不久即坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:37
#: 3b05ececdd5d46208be9be5ce80c6a54
msgid "Check Online Forums"
msgstr "查阅在线论坛"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:39
#: c260b8e0a46a408ead4c35e70451c084
msgid ""
"You should also check online forums for other people who have flown the same"
" plane. It is very common for the correct CoG to be discussed."
msgstr "还应查阅在线论坛，了解其他飞过同款飞机的用户的经验。关于正确重心的讨论十分普遍。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:43
#: f8830e0613324b0e985025e33f683791
msgid "Correct After First Flight"
msgstr "首次飞行后修正"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:45
#: 3e5a6cde53ed4e3faa1e8ce02a56cc04
msgid ""
"One of the key things you should check after your first flight is whether "
"your CoG was in fact correct. Check your flight log and look at the state of"
" the pitch integrator. The pitch integrator is in the PIDP.I field in your "
"dataflash log."
msgstr "首次飞行后，应检查重心是否确实正确。查阅飞行日志并查看俯仰积分器的状态，俯仰积分器在数据日志中的字段为 PIDP.I。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:50
#: c4bbeb8f94374f0f849e2d753d4ba04d
msgid ""
"If your plane showed a value of PIDP.I consistently above zero then your "
"plane was needing to put in up elevator to stay level. Your plane is "
"probably a bit nose heavy, or your elevator trim is incorrect."
msgstr "若 PIDP.I 值持续高于零，说明飞机需要持续上压升降舵来保持平飞，飞机可能偏机头重，或升降舵配平不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-center-of-gravity.rst:54
#: ad50609d0b0d4784b1216032ef75e46d
msgid ""
"If your plane showed a value of PIDP.I consistently below zero then your "
"plane was needing to put in down elevator to stay level. Your plane is "
"probably a bit tail heavy, or your elevator trim is incorrect."
msgstr "若 PIDP.I 值持续低于零，说明飞机需要持续下压升降舵来保持平飞，飞机可能偏机尾重，或升降舵配平不正确。"
